  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing the burden of TB and TB/HIV co-infection in Solomon Islands/Delivering high impact HIV/AIDS services to key populations in Solomon Islands - Solomon Islands (01-Jan-2018-31-Dec-2020)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands, TB/HIV, Solomon Islands Ministry of Health and Medical Services (MHMS)This program has the following goals: To reduce the burden of TB and TB/HIV co-infection in Solomon Islands. The objectives of this program are: Enhance patient centered care and prevention.  Pursue policies and systems supporting TB prevention, care and control.  Intensify operational research and uptake new tools and interventions</narrative>
  </description>
